id=n770f_fod_fixer
name=N770F FOD fixer (ColorOS / AOSP ports)
version=v1
versionCode=1
author=n770f
description=Galaxy Note10 Lite optical in-display fingerprint for ports that detect the wrong sensor type: forces optical UDFPS (props + config_udfps_sensor_props overlay at 540,2169 r100), the optical feature flag, the ColorOS light-spot props and the FOD mask brightness, and writes a report to /data/adb/n770f_fod_fixer/report.txt (Action button re-runs it).
